------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (web source reproduced)
------------------------------------------------------------
- Tier: pure presentational leaf (web has NO hooks / NO fetch). Per the P4 leaf contract the
  surface is wrapped in the shared state-holder seam (P1/S8) so it binds through MetricCardModel
  (no HTTP in the view) and renders every leaf state.
- Props reproduced 1:1 (MetricCardInput): label, value (string|number -> .text/.number/.absent),
  icon (SF Symbol), color (NeonColor -> MetricCardAccent), legacy `change` pill, direction-aware
  `delta`, subtitle, help (HelpTooltip).
- Delta footer = a line-by-line port of Delta.tsx: deltaCurrent = delta.current ?? numericValue;
  missing inputs -> em-dash/no colour/no arrow; zero delta -> flat arrow + muted; neutral direction
  -> secondary; (higher_better & up)||(lower_better & down) -> success else danger; percent with
  previous==0 -> em-dash; absolute/percent/both forms; prefix/suffix formatting; arrow encodes the
  sign, magnitude always positive. Legacy `change` pill only when `change && !delta`.
- NeonColor -> theme-aware semantic tokens (Color.TS.accent/statusSuccess/statusDanger/
  statusWarning/statusInfo/chartSeriesPower) so the icon tile inverts correctly in light mode.
- States (all rendered — no hidden surface): loading (skeleton), data (value + change/delta footer
  + icon + help), empty (em-dash + friendly note, never blank), error (retryable). The orthogonal
  connection axis (live/stale/offline) drives a corner freshness chip with a one-shot auto-refresh
  on the stale transition.
- i18n (P1/S10): all native chrome prose via the MetricCardStrings facade -> "MetricCard" table
  (MetricCard.strings): metricCard.empty/loadingA11y/errorTitle/retry/help.moreInfo/live/stale/
  offline. label/value/subtitle/help-body are caller-provided DATA (rendered verbatim), not
  literals. No English string literals in Swift.
- Accessibility: composed VoiceOver label "{label}: {value}. {subtitle}. {change}" on the value
  element; help button + freshness chip stay independently reachable; icon hidden; Dynamic Type
  (Font.TS), reduce-motion honored (TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton gate their animation).
- Telemetry (P1/S11): emits view.opened with surface slug "MetricCard" once on first presentation
  (OSLogMetricCardTelemetry default; production injects the shared diagnostics sink).

